    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How did I get here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memories flood back - explosions, gunfire, screams.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happened? What were those things? Then it hits you - the fall of Swanfield, the chaos, running for your life, the desperate need to escape, and then... darkness. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You passed out, utterly drained, with vague recollections of that night's horrors sending shivers down your spine. But now, a glimmer of hope - rescue. Am I safe?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world you knew is gone. There's no home, no safety. You have to rebuild. Today marks a new beginning, a chance to start over. A New Dawn.<u><br><br>What to expect?</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a detailed open world with diverse environments such as Cities, Forests, Suburbs, and Rural areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system that includes both melee and ranged weapons, with realistic physics and damage mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and prepare to venture into dangerous locations such as Quarantine Zones, Underground Bases, Airfields and Military Outposts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources such as food, fluids, ammunitions and building materials efficiently to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Weapons, Tools, Shelter, and other essential items using resources found in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish, Build and Upgrade a base for protection against Wildlife, Zombies and Hostile Survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building includes, Storage, Fortifications and resource production facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Basic Weapons and gathering tools from the start of your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge and Loot for everything you need to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game currency to buy and sell goods at resource vendors, scavenge rare and in-demand items to sell and buy what you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the elements, stay warm, well fed, hydrated and ready to move quickly</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How did I get here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memories flood back - explosions, gunfire, screams.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What happened? What were those things? Then it hits you - the fall of Swanfield, the chaos, running for your life, the desperate need to escape, and then... darkness. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You passed out, utterly drained, with vague recollections of that night's horrors sending shivers down your spine. But now, a glimmer of hope - rescue. Am I safe?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world you knew is gone. There's no home, no safety. You have to rebuild. Today marks a new beginning, a chance to start over. A New Dawn.<u><br><br>What to expect?</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a detailed open world with diverse environments such as Cities, Forests, Suburbs, and Rural areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system that includes both melee and ranged weapons, with realistic physics and damage mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip and prepare to venture into dangerous locations such as Quarantine Zones, Underground Bases, Airfields and Military Outposts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources such as food, fluids, ammunitions and building materials efficiently to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Weapons, Tools, Shelter, and other essential items using resources found in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish, Build and Upgrade a base for protection against Wildlife, Zombies and Hostile Survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building includes, Storage, Fortifications and resource production facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Basic Weapons and gathering tools from the start of your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge and Loot for everything you need to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game currency to buy and sell goods at resource vendors, scavenge rare and in-demand items to sell and buy what you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the elements, stay warm, well fed, hydrated and ready to move quickly</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Swanfield Survival is a Post-Apocalypic Zombie Survival game, with PvE and PvP Elements with Online Co-Op &amp; Multiplayer. You can connect via Dedicated Servers, or host a session with up to 5 friends. Climbing, Swimming, Looting, Crafting, Building, Fishing, Farming are all available from start!",
